{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"action\": \"advisory_preparation\",\n  \"summary\": \"Meaningful SFTP coverage requires a reachable SFTP server; the artifact’s Apache MINA client dependencies are already transitive.\",\n  \"deterministic_setup\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"docker_image\",\n      \"image\": \"atmoz/sftp:debian\",\n      \"slug\": \"atmoz_sftp_debian\",\n      \"reason\": \"Spring Integration SFTP is a client integration library, and its documented adapters require an actual SSH/SFTP endpoint for upload, download, and session coverage.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"agent_guidance\": \"Start the container with a deterministic test user and published port, for example user `test` with password `test` and an upload directory. Configure DefaultSftpSessionFactory or equivalent test properties to connect to localhost on the mapped port, authenticate with those credentials, and use test-managed temporary local and remote directories. Avoid relying on a pre-existing host-key file; configure the test verifier explicitly for the ephemeral test server.\",\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"The Docker image tag is mutable; local and CI verification must confirm the pulled image and server behavior.\",\n    \"Tests must cleanly stop the container and remove temporary files.\",\n    \"SSH host-key verification and authentication defaults may otherwise make tests fail before exercising Spring Integration code.\"\n  ]\n}\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1788982959742}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_vu7JyWQ9ScY0xVFJMKyJONaG|fc_0ee8e5ae36082017016aa1b6af7d6887d2839f238c11cf92d3", "toolName": "read", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Command: ./gradlew generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport -Pcoordinates=org.springframework.integration:spring-integration-sftp:7.1.1\nWorking directory: /home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata-copy/forge/local_repositories/forge_worktrees/9952-d8bcca1b\n\n--- output ---\n> Task :tck-build-logic:extractPluginRequests UP-TO-DATE\n> Tas